The source code of Flowable was modified for Flowlane. Modifications include:
- Removal of all parts of the flowable-engine repository except the UI applications.
- Move of the UI applications from modules/flowable-ui to the root folder of the repository.
- Renaming of the Maven coordinates from org.flowable:flowable-ui-* to de.aniondev.flowlane:flowlane-*.
- Renaming of the Java packages from org.flowable.ui to de.aniondev.flowlane.
- Renaming of classes (for example FlowableUiApplication to FlowlaneApplication).
- Renaming of the configuration keys flowable.{common,admin,idm,task,modeler}.app to flowlane.{common,admin,idm,task,modeler}.app.
- Renaming of user interface texts which refer to the UI applications from Flowable to Flowlane.
- Pinning of the used Flowable engine libraries to version 6.8.0.
